language ESSENCE' 1.0

$ 5x5 Akari puzzle.
$ Black cells (B) and numbered clues:
$
$   .  .  .  .  .
$   .  B0 .  B0 .
$   .  .  B0 .  .
$   .  B0 .  B0 .
$   .  .  .  .  .
$
$ Unique solution: bulbs at (1,3), (3,1), (3,5), (5,3).
$
$ Deduction chain:
$   1. B0@(3,3) blocks (2,3) and (4,3) -> col 3 upper/lower segments must use (1,3) and (5,3)
$   2. (1,3) bulb in all-white row 1 eliminates (1,1) and (1,5)
$   3. (5,3) bulb in all-white row 5 eliminates (5,1) and (5,5)
$   4. Col 1 only viable position is (3,1); col 5 only viable position is (3,5)
$
$ Encoding: -1=black(no number), 0-4=numbered black, 5=white

letting height be 5
letting width be 5
letting start_grid be [
    [ 5, 5, 5, 5, 5],
    [ 5, 0, 5, 0, 5],
    [ 5, 5, 0, 5, 5],
    [ 5, 0, 5, 0, 5],
    [ 5, 5, 5, 5, 5]
]
